  "title": "Answer: lived time has thickness, physical time is open",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "5f3c93bb-dbba-4630-849b-72533228406a",
      "text": "Physical time is causally open: the present is not fixed by the past. Lived time comes from prehensions that take time, so the now has thickness and retains the past.",
